@ 1:2  k|anban
  1:1-1:7 "kanban"
  | **`kanban`**
  |
  | `kanban`: starts a kanban board; its columns and cards follow, one per line.
@ 4:9  ::ic|on(fa fa-book)
  4:5-4:12 "::icon("
  | **`::icon(`**
  |
  | `::icon(…)`: the icon of the last item, on a line of its own.
@ 5:6  :|::urgent
  5:5-5:8 ":::"
  | **`:::`**
  |
  | `:::class …`: the classes of the last item, on a line of its own; a later one replaces them.
